*> Block argument of the part 6 emitters: L-P the block position (X, Y, Z) and L-PROPS twelve integers whose meaning is
*> given per class in the header of the source file.
 01 L-P.
    05 L-PP                BINARY-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 01 L-PROPS.
    05 L-PR                BINARY-LONG OCCURS 12 TIMES.
